properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 11}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["**⚠️ 本工作流为展示版：请先从我们的 GitHub 下载精心微调后的完整节点包和工作流再使用**\nhttps://github.com/LynnReal-AI/LynnReal-Omni/tree/main/comfyui\n\n## LynnReal Standard · 4-step DMD (Ref2VA)\n\nThis copy of the official R2V template is wired for the LynnReal Standard checkpoint.\n\n**Changes from the official template**\n\n- `UNETLoader`: `lynnreal_omni_standard_bf16.safetensors` (BF16, full-form adaLN, fused QKV)\n- `BasicScheduler`: `simple` with **4 steps**. Sigma shift stays at the model default, video 12 / audio 3.\n- `KSamplerSelect`: `euler`, the solver the checkpoint was distilled against. `res_multistep` also runs, but can drift at 4 steps.\n- The Lightning LoRA and the model / steps switches are removed; this checkpoint is already distilled.\n- `ref_image_size`: `max` (2048 short edge), matching the diffusers reference pipeline default.\n\nText encoder and both VAE loaders are unchanged from the official template.\n\n**Precision — INT8 (optional)**\n\nThe **`Use INT8 model?`** switch above the loader (default **off**) swaps `UNETLoader` from\n`lynnreal_omni_standard_bf16.safetensors` to `lynnreal_omni_standard_int8.safetensors`. Same\nW8A8 contract as the release's `--precision int8` path: per-output-channel weight scales,\nper-token activation scales, INT32 accumulate; block 0, the last block, the token refiner,\nadaLN and the IO projections stay BF16.\n\n**Links**\n\n- Code: https://github.com/LynnReal-AI/LynnReal-Omni\n- Paper: https://huggingface.co/papers/2609.15863\n- Weights: https://huggingface.co/stdstu123/LynnReal-Onmi-beta-0.1\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Note: LynnReal Standard 4-step DMD", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [440, 961], "pos": [-2500, 5700], "id": 200, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 12}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [252, 292], "label": "output", "type": "*", "loc